made for.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:00.960
Just use them, and you can solve a lot

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.520
of your pain.

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:03.640
And you might run into a situation

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:05.440
basically the

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:07.480
the data API is just your database

