like state machiney thing where the

00:10:58.040 --> 00:10:59.600
front end's like pushing data and then

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:01.080
fetching it back out of the back end.

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:02.960
It's kind of this unidirectional flow,

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:05.080
and I think a lot of like this happened

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:06.920
in React. We had React for like a year

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:08.360
and a year and a half, and then people

