for the amount of complexity people were

00:11:18.839 --> 00:11:21.200
using to add React into their apps. And

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.839
all this stuff like Flux came out, and

00:11:22.839 --> 00:11:24.520
there was explosion of like six

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:26.200
different frameworks all came out that

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.800
one summer of like how do you do this

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:30.480
unidirectional data flow? Because it was

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:32.240
what worked for real-time dynamic

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:33.880
applications.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.320
Yeah, and this is a pattern that we've

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:37.320
